{% comment %}
WILD BEANS — STORY + TEAM (Docu, Chapitré, Slides plein écran + Scroll Snap)
{% endcomment %}

<section
  id="wild-beans-story-team"
  class="w-screen h-screen overflow-y-scroll"
>

  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- SLIDE 1 : OUR STORY + CHAPTER 01 -->
  <!-- =============================== -->

  <section class="sm:w-2/3 min-h-screen flex items-center js-safe-layout">
    <div class=" px-4 space-y-6 md:space-y-8">

      <h2
        class="typewriter-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight
               opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform
               transition-all duration-[2200ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:0ms;"
      >
        Our Story
      </h2>

      <!-- CHAPTER 01 HEADER -->
      <div
        class="space-y-1 opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform
               transition-all duration-[1800ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:400ms;"
      >
        <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-neutral-500">
          CHAPTER 01
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight">
          The Intuition
        </h3>
      </div>

      <p
        class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide 
               opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform
               transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:700ms;"
      >
        Wild Beans was born from a simple observation made by Vincent Rousseau on ad production sets:
        long days, tight schedules, and yet rarely a truly good cup of coffee. Before launching Wild Beans,
        Vincent had already founded 
        <a href="https://www.betterbewild.fr/paris" class="underline" target="_blank">
          Better Be Wild</a>,
        a Paris-based production company known for its ambitious creative direction and seamless on-set
        organization.
      </p>

      <!-- CH1 IMAGES -->
      <div class="max-w-[1400px] grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">

        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.story_img_1 | img_url: '1600x' }}"
          alt="Better Be Wild – Production"
          class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 sm:h-96 w-full shadow-lg opacity-0 translate-y-6
                 will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:950ms;"
        />

        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.story_img_2 | img_url: '1600x' }}"
          alt="Behind the scenes – Vincent Rousseau"
          class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 sm:h-96 w-full shadow-lg opacity-0 translate-y-6
                 will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:1150ms;"
        />

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- SLIDE 2 : CHAPTER 02 -->
  <!-- =============================== -->

  <section class="sm:w-2/3 min-h-screen flex items-center">
    <div class="w-full max-w-[1400px] px-4 space-y-4 md:space-y-6">

      <div
        class="space-y-1 opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform
               transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:200ms;"
      >
        <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-neutral-500">
          CHAPTER 02
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight">
          The Meeting
        </h3>
      </div>

      <p
        class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide opacity-0 translate-y-6
               will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:500ms;"
      >
        The project reached a new level when Vincent met Tom Darval, a barista with over 13 years in
        specialty coffee. Known for his mastery of sourcing, roasting profiles, extraction techniques,
        and coffee culture, Tom brought the technical depth Wild Beans needed. Beyond his work with
        Wild Beans, he is currently filming a documentary series with Arte.
      </p>

      <div class="max-w-[1400px] grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">

        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.tom_doc_img | img_url: '1600x' }}"
          alt="Tom Darval filming Arte documentary"
          class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 sm:h-96 w-full shadow-lg opacity-0 translate-y-6
                 will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:800ms;"
        />
         <img
          src="{{ section.settings.tom_doc_img2 | img_url: '1600x' }}"
          alt="On-set coffee service – Wild Beans"
          class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 sm:h-96 w-full shadow-lg opacity-0 translate-y-6
                 will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:800ms;"
        />

        <p
          class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500 italic opacity-0 translate-y-6
                 will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1800ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:1050ms;"
        >
          Tom filming his documentary series with Arte, capturing stories from the world of coffee.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- SLIDE 3 : CHAPTER 03 -->
  <!-- =============================== -->

  <section class="sm:w-2/3 min-h-screen flex items-center">
    <div class="w-full max-w-[1400px] px-4 space-y-4 md:space-y-6">

      <div
        class="space-y-1 opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform
               transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:200ms;"
      >
        <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-neutral-500">
          CHAPTER 03
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight">
          On-Set Expertise
        </h3>
      </div>

      <p
        class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide opacity-0 translate-y-6
               will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:500ms;"
      >
        With their complementary strengths : Vincent’s understanding of on-set realities and Tom’s specialty
        coffee expertise—Wild Beans evolved into a premium coffee service created specifically for shoots
        and production events.
      </p>

      <div class="max-w-[1400px] grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">

        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.chapter3_img_1 | img_url: '1600x' }}"
          alt="On-set coffee service – Wild Beans"
          class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 sm:h-96 w-full shadow-lg opacity-0 translate-y-6
                 will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:800ms;"
        />

        <img
          src="{{ section.settings.chapter3_img_2 | img_url: '1600x' }}"
          alt="Barista station – Wild Beans"
          class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 sm:h-96 w-full shadow-lg opacity-0 translate-y-6
                 will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:1050ms;"
        />

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- SLIDE 4 : CHAPTER 04 + LINKS -->
  <!-- =============================== -->

  <section class="sm:w-2/3 min-h-screen flex items-center">
    <div class="w-full max-w-[1400px] px-4 space-y-6 md:space-y-8">

      <div
        class="space-y-1 opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform
               transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:200ms;"
      >
        <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-neutral-500">
          CHAPTER 04
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight">
          The Future
        </h3>
      </div>

      <p
        class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide opacity-0 translate-y-6
               will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:500ms;"
      >
        Looking ahead, Wild Beans is expanding through two major projects: our own coffee line, and BEANS,
        a media project and YouTube channel exploring global coffee culture.
      </p>

      <div class="max-w-[1400px] grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">

        <a href="/products" class="group block space-y-2">
          <img
            src="{{ section.settings.brand_img | img_url: '1600x' }}"
            alt="Wild Beans Coffee – Our Products"
            class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 sm:h-96 w-full shadow-lg opacity-0 translate-y-6
                   will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]
                   group-hover:opacity-90"
            data-scroll-fade
            style="transition-delay:800ms;"
          />
          <p
            class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide opacity-0 translate-y-6
                   will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1700ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
            data-scroll-fade
            style="transition-delay:1050ms;"
          >
            Discover Wild Beans Coffee →
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@wildbeans" target="_blank" class="group block space-y-2">

          <img
            src="{{ section.settings.youtube_img | img_url: '1600x' }}"
            alt="Beans – YouTube Channel"
            class="rounded-2xl object-cover h-80 sm:h-96  w-full shadow-lg opacity-0 translate-y-6
                   will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]
                   group-hover:opacity-90"
            data-scroll-fade
            style="transition-delay:850ms;"
          />

          <p
            class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide opacity-0 translate-y-6
                   will-change-transform transition-all duration-[1700ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
            data-scroll-fade
            style="transition-delay:1100ms;"
          >
            Explore Beans on YouTube →
          </p>
        </a>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- =============================== -->
  <!-- SLIDE 5 : TEAM SECTION -->
  <!-- =============================== -->

  <section class="sm:w-2/3 min-h-screen flex items-center">
    <div class="w-full max-w-[1400px] px-4 space-y-8 md:space-y-10">

      <div
        class="space-y-2 opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform
               transition-all duration-[1900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.19,1,0.22,1)]"
        data-scroll-fade
        style="transition-delay:300ms;"
      >
        <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-neutral-400">
          CAST & CREW
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">
          The Wild Beans Team
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">

        <!-- VINCENT -->
        <article
          class="group flex flex-col items-start text-left rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/60 
                 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 
                 transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:600ms;"
        >
          <img
            src="{{ section.settings.vincent_image | img_url: '600x' }}"
            alt="Portrait of Vincent Rousseau"
            class="h-56 w-56 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md ring-2 ring-neutral-100 mb-6"
          />

          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold uppercase">Vincent Rousseau</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-500 mb-4">
            Founder &amp; Production Lead
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base uppercase leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
            Vincent leads operations, planning, logistics, and on-set coordination.
          </p>
        </article>

        <!-- TOM -->
        <article
          class="group flex flex-col items-start text-left rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/60 
                 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 
                 transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:750ms;"
        >
          <img
            src="{{ section.settings.tom_image | img_url: '600x' }}"
            alt="Portrait of Tom Darval"
            class="h-56 w-56 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md ring-2 ring-neutral-100 mb-6"
          />

          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold uppercase">Tom Darval</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-500 mb-4">
            Head of Coffee &amp; Experience
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base uppercase leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
            Tom defines the coffee direction, bean selection, training, and standards.
          </p>
        </article>

        <!-- PB -->
        <article
          class="group flex flex-col items-start text-left rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/60 
                 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 
                 transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6 will-change-transform"
          data-scroll-fade
          style="transition-delay:900ms;"
        >
          <img
            src="{{ section.settings.pb_image | img_url: '600x' }}"
            alt="Portrait of Pierre-Baptiste Rozic"
            class="h-56 w-56 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md ring-2 ring-neutral-100 mb-6"
          />

          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold uppercase">Pierre-Baptiste Rozic</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-500 mb-4">
            Barista &amp; Logistics Support
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base uppercase leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
            Supports coffee service, logistics, and setup throughout the production day.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</section>


{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Wild Beans – Story",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "story_img_1", "label": "Story image 1" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "story_img_2", "label": "Story image 2" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "tom_doc_img", "label": "Tom documentary image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "tom_doc_img2", "label": "Tom documentary image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "brand_img", "label": "Brand image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "youtube_img", "label": "YouTube image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "vincent_image", "label": "Vincent image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "tom_image", "label": "Tom image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "pb_image", "label": "PB image" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "chapter3_img_1", "label": "Chapter 3 image 1" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "chapter3_img_2", "label": "Chapter 3 image 2" }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Wild Beans – Story + Team (Editorial Left, Slides)" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
